{"obsah":"<p>The sports clubs' ball was a big surprise. 600+ spectators, the great setting of the cultural centre hall and loads of side programme for sportsmen and sportswomen. Vlasta, Lukáš Valný and Tobík Dolák even had plenty of space backstage for a warm-up, which had its own spectators. The waxed floor was a bit of a struggle, and there were a few crowd-pleasing crashes (luckily on the flat and harmless). After the classic intro on the obstacles we moved on to the male and female volunteers. The highlight was a riders vs walkers high-jump battle. It was no surprise that on the slippery floor the jumper without a bike won, but nobody expected it to be a rugby player. Thanks for the warm welcome and the cheering – hopefully we'll meet on a bigger scale at a summer event.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F02%2FKralupy-nad-vltavou1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F02%2FKralupy-nad-vltavou1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-251174\"/></a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Kralupy nad Vltavou</figcaption></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F02%2FKralupy-nad-vltavou2.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F02%2FKralupy-nad-vltavou2.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-251175\"/></a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Kralupy nad Vltavou</figcaption></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorag